    narr:narration """The trajectory of this hub traces the evolution of [decision capture as a core product differentiator](narr:Position_CoreFeatureDecisionCapture), moving from its March 2026 strategic framing as a primary artifact-generation mechanism to its concrete implementation in July 2026. The current focus centers on the [Sprint 4 delivery account](narr:Position_Sprint4DeliveryAccount), which serves as the primary lens for evaluating recent technical milestones. The team reports the [shipment of the async decision widget](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1784715317938_1) as a central achievement, linking this output to a [highest quarterly velocity of 23 points](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1784715317938_2). This performance is explicitly attributed to the [Zephyr integration](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1784715317938_3), which is cited as the critical technical unlock for the sprint's success. The span remains anchored in the tension between high-level strategic intent and the empirical, velocity-based evidence of delivery.""" ;
